%% 03-text.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 3 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% Sizing and spacing: %size, %vgap, %hgap, %prefix, %cont.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "DarkSlateBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Sizing text

deck 3 of 10: size, gaps, prefixes, joins
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%size

%left, fore "white"
%size 7
size 7 draws this big
%size 5
size 5 draws this big
%size 3
size 3 draws this big
%size 4, fore "gray70"

the unit is percent of SCREEN HEIGHT, so a deck
looks the same at any window size - size 7 means
about 14 lines would fill the screen
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%vgap - line spacing

%left, size 4, fore "white", vgap 10
vgap 10 packs lines
tight like this
%vgap 100
vgap 100 doubles the space
%vgap 10
%size 4, fore "gray70"

the number is percent of the current char size,
ADDED between lines: 0 touches, 100 = one line
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%hgap - letter spacing

%left, size 4, fore "white"
%hgap 0
normal spacing
%hgap 30
s p r e a d  o u t
%hgap 0
%size 4, fore "gray70"

hgap pads between characters - use sparingly,
titles and logos only
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%prefix - indent

%left, size 4, fore "white"
%prefix "  "
prefix "  " - indent by two spaces
%prefix "        "
prefix "        " - eight
%prefix 25
prefix 25 - a QUOTED prefix is literal text;
a BARE NUMBER is percent of the page width
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%cont - joining lines

%left, size 5
%fore "white"
one drawn line
%cont, fore "orange"
 from three
%cont, fore "cyan"
 source lines
%size 4, fore "gray70"

\%cont glues a source line onto the previous one,
so each PIECE can carry its own size and color
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Put together

	big titles: size 8 or 9
	body text: size 4 or 5
	fine print: size 3
	let vgap breathe: 20 to 40 for body
%pause
%size 4, center, fore "SpringGreen"

readable beats clever - when in doubt, go bigger
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 04-color.mgp
